### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 8. Add your own requests here for the rules in ASSIGNMENT.md

### R9-1: maria, first booking of the day (expected 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "maria", "startUtc": "2030-05-01T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-05-01T11:00:00Z", "attendees": 2 }

### R9-2: maria, second booking of the day (expected 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "maria", "startUtc": "2030-05-01T12:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-05-01T13:00:00Z", "attendees": 2 }

### R9-3: maria, third booking of the same day (expected 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "maria", "startUtc": "2030-05-01T14:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-05-01T15:00:00Z", "attendees": 2 }

### R9-4: maria, another day (expected 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookedBy": "maria", "startUtc": "2030-05-02T10:00:00Z", "endUtc": "2030-05-02T11:00:00Z", "attendees": 2 }
